@HostAddress = http://localhost:5199

### 1. Lab 15: Common API Response - Get All Students
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Students
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Lab 16: Route Constraint - Int & Range (id: 1..100)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Students/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Lab 16: Route Constraint - Alpha (category: e.g. "engineering")
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Students/category/engineering
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Lab 16: Route Constraint - Regex (code: 3 uppercase + 3 digits, e.g. "CSE101")
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Students/code/CSE101
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Lab 17: Model Binding - [FromQuery] (Filter parameters)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Students/filter?department=Computer&minAge=18&pageNumber=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Lab 17: Model Binding - [FromBody] (Create student via JSON payload)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bhavik Parmar",
  "email": "bhavik@college.edu",
  "age": 21,
  "department": "Computer Engineering",
  "studentCode": "CSE121"
}

###

### 7. Lab 17: Model Binding - [FromHeader]
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Students/header-info
X-Client-App: CollegeDemoClient
X-Request-Id: REQ-COLLEGE-999
Accept: application/json

###
